[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Public Low Level Requirements
UID: GSSC-PUBLIC-LOW-LEVEL-REQUIREMENTS
VERSION: 5.0.0

[GRAMMAR]
ELEMENTS:
- TAG: TEXT
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: SECTION
  PROPERTIES:
    IS_COMPOSITE: True
    PREFIX: None
    VIEW_STYLE: Narrative
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
- TAG: REQUIREMENT
  PROPERTIES:
    PREFIX: GSSC-PLLR-
    VIEW_STYLE: Table
  FIELDS:
  - TITLE: UID
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: TITLE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: STATEMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: RATIONALE
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: COMMENT
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: False
  - TITLE: DERIVED
    TYPE: SingleChoice(True, False)
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: VERIFICATION_METHOD
    TYPE: SingleChoice(Test, Inspection)
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: CHANGE_DRIVER
    TYPE: String
    REQUIRED: True
  - TITLE: REVIEW_STATUS
    TYPE: SingleChoice(Changed, Approved, Baselined)
    REQUIRED: True
  RELATIONS:
  - TYPE: Parent
    ROLE: Refines
    REVERSE_ROLE: Refined By

[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-APP-ROOT
TITLE: Public App Root

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-4
TITLE: Public App Root Composition
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL compose a Header host, an Announcements Bar, a routed page outlet, and a Footer host.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The App Root is the shell that hosts Header, Footer, the Announcements Bar, and the active public page. Header and Footer contents are separate requirements.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-5
TITLE: Header Host Placement
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL place the Header host at the top of the page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Common public pages place the Header at the top. The App Root supplies that host for Header implementation.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-44
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-6
TITLE: Footer Host Placement
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL place the Footer host at the bottom of the page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Common public pages place the Footer at the bottom. The App Root supplies that host for Footer implementation.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-46
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-7
TITLE: Routed Page Outlet
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL render the active public page through a router outlet between the Header host and the Footer host.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Public pages mount through the App Root router outlet so each page shares the same shell.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-128
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

