UID: GSSC-PLLR-8
TITLE: Home Page Route
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend Router SHALL open the public home page at the root path.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Navigation Menu reaches the public home page through this route.
<<<
