[[SECTION]]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-ANNOUNCEMENTS-BAR
TITLE: Announcements Bar

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-15
TITLE: Announcements Bar on Non-Home Pages
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL show the Announcements Bar on every public page other than the home page when there is an urgent public announcement to display.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The Urgent Announcement Container belongs on non-home public pages when an urgent announcement exists. The home page announcements display is separate.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-27
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-47
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-16
TITLE: Announcements Bar Home Exclusion
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Public Frontend App Root SHALL omit the Announcements Bar on the home page.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The home page uses the Announcements Display instead of the Announcements Bar.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-27
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-17
TITLE: Announcements Bar Title
STATEMENT: >>>
The Announcements Bar SHALL include the title of each urgent public announcement it displays.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The title is part of the urgent announcement contents shown in the bar.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-30
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-18
TITLE: Announcements Bar Text
STATEMENT: >>>
The Announcements Bar SHALL include the text of each urgent public announcement it displays.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The text is part of the urgent announcement contents shown in the bar.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-31
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-PLLR-19
TITLE: Announcements Bar Selection
STATEMENT: >>>
Selecting an announcement in the Announcements Bar SHALL open the home page announcements display focused on that announcement.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The bar is a way to reach the selected announcement on the home page announcements display.
<<<
DERIVED: False
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-38
REVIEW_STATUS: Changed
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PHLR-34
  ROLE: Refines

